    "preamble": "Smt. K. Das Gupta & Anr vs The State Of West Bengal & Anr on 4 May, 2022 Author: Tirthankar Ghosh Bench: Tirthankar Ghosh 04.05.2022 In The High Court At Calcutta Item No.28 Criminal Revisional Jurisdiction Ct.No.34 dc. C.R.R. 359 of 2013 with Cran 1 of 2013 (Old No. Cran 366 of 2013) Smt. K. Das Gupta & Anr. versus The State of West Bengal & Anr.",
    "facts": "Earlier a report was called for from the Officer-in- Charge, New Market Police Station, but the records of the case could not be traced according to the report. This revisional application, till date, has not been admitted before this Court as the application under Section 5 of the Limitation Act is still pending for consideration. None appears for the petitioners today and on an earlier occasion i.e. on 18.04.2022 also none appeared or represented the petitioners.",
